 "dependencies_reviewed": true,
 "dependency_review": "Inspected every path listed. The three editable projects each carry their own index.html and assets. Generators: aieducation_scene.py (shared), the three lane generators and the cutout envelope, plus the shared code they import (captions.py, pointing_cues.py, matting/selection.py, formats/cutout/lib, formats/whiteboard/lib). Media and timing: the raw recording, its Scribe transcript and the whole cuts/aieducation set the word-synced captions read. Matting: the shorts_run22/matting/aieducation session whose contour Astra redrew (selection.json with one exclude polygon, its .pre_astra backups and the astra_contour_review folder) and the three shipped v5 layers the cutout composites; a stale duplicate at pipeline/sam2/sessions/aieducation.stale_run22 is deliberately NOT referenced. Config and paperwork: every gen/_* build, geometry, prerender, phone-page, render-control and QC record. Review: the approval record, the clerk report, the phone reader/scores/pass records and the matte viewer sheets. Approved by Miguel on the delivered renders, 2026-09-16. External runtime dependencies recorded not vendored: GSAP and Google Fonts fetched at render time, HyperFrames installed globally, ffmpeg for encode. No secrets and no other Short's files."
}
